WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.764 --> 00:00:03.347
(gentle music)

00:00:11.198 --> 00:00:13.570
- Hi Lucy, good morning.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.180
It's me, Henry.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:20.180
We are on, I think about
our 5,000th date together.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.570
It's been great.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.571
I'm gonna catch you up.

00:00:22.571 --> 00:00:24.570
(gentle music)

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:29.060
You have a thing called
amnesia and I am your husband.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.830
We have a daughter and she's about 40 now,

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.710
or something like that.
- Wait, what?

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.680
I know it's bananas, but I'm not done yet.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:42.680
It's 2020 and we're also in
the middle of a pandemic,

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.020
which is a terrible thing.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.340
Baseball games are now being played

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.615
in front of cardboard people.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.090
(crickets chirping)

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.570
- Sounds kind of like
you're making this up.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.403
- Oh yes.

00:00:53.403 --> 00:00:57.953
If the room you're in right
now smells a bit like farts,

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:00.213
that was you.

00:01:00.213 --> 00:01:02.570
- It does kind of smell
like farts in here.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:04.370
Are you sure that wasn't you?

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.210
- Oh, it doesn't matter, either way.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.210
There is good stuff going
on in the world though.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:10.090
There's a company called Netflix

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.440
that provides premium
entertainment to people

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.800
right in the comfort of their own home.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.830
They also pay me,

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:18.210
so that's why we can
have that house together.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:23.210
So to recap, 2020 is not
great, Netflix is good,

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:27.413
and you fart a lot in your sleep.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:30.110
Drew, in all seriousness though,

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.350
I want to just tell you this.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.040
I couldn't honestly be
more excited for you.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.880
You have your own show now.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.120
- Hi, I'm Tom.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.000
Lucy's got her own show now?

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.070
- Tom!

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.140
- Yes, yes.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.970
10 Second Tom, that's right.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.270
- That's great!

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:46.470
Who's Lucy?

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.870
And why is everyone
outside wearing a mask?

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.970
- Okay, Tom, that's
enough, you gotta go now.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:52.080
- Okay.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.450
- You are gonna make
people so happy every day,

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:55.850
every time they see you.

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:56.890
You are magic.

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:58.040
The whole world feels it,

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.330
and I'm lucky that I know you so well.

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:01.340
I love you.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:03.280
- I can't think of any endeavor

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.890
I'd ever want to do without you, Adam.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.460
So thanks, and I love you.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.403
- Hi, I'm Tom!

